			"notes": "## Summary\nThis release adds **Minecraft 1.21.11** support and resolves critical particle-related crashes and invisibility bugs for cross-version clients.  \n\n<br>\n\n## Highlights\n- **1.21.11 Support:** Updated mod environment for compatibility with the latest server version.\n\n- **Particle Packet Correction:**\n  - Resolved `DecoderException: found extra bytes` by stripping non-standard Fabric API data from particle packets.\n  - Ensures 100% compatibility with **ViaVersion** and older clients.\n\n- **Visual Fixes:**\n  - Fixed invisible `BlockState` particles (e.g., `block_marker`).\n  - Restored block particles during player landing effects.\n\n- **Refactoring:** Cleaned up internal class structures and file naming."
		},
